      "options": {
        "prompt": "I'm studying for the CompTIA Security+ certification and want to receive 5 unique practice questions via email each day.\r\n\r\nUse the following link as a reference for question style and difficulty:\r\nhttps://www.comptia.org/en-us/certifications/security/practice-questions/\r\n\r\nYour task:\r\n- Generate 5 original Security+ practice questions.\r\n- Do not repeat questions from previous days.\r\n- Format the output as a clean, well-structured HTML message suitable for email.\r\n- Include the questions and multiple-choice answers (A–D).\r\n- Do not include any commentary, explanations, or extra text outside the HTML.\r\n\r\nOutput only the HTML content.\r",
